# All three images build with the repo root as context (pnpm workspace). Allow-list, so `.env`,
# the corpus, caches and local builds never reach a build context.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/
!packages/
!config/
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/.venv
**/.cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.tsbuildinfo
